#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1957 main.lua:20156
msgid "Trusted Providers: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1960
msgid ""
"Providers you trust bypass all data sharing controls below AND text "
"extraction. All data types (highlights, annotations, notebook, book text) "
"are available without toggling individual settings. Use for local Ollama "
"instances or providers you fully trust.\n"
"\n"
"Trust also satisfies the consent that background features (such as Automatic "
"X-Ray and X-Ray checkpoint builds) check before running; those can then "
"extract text and spend tokens without a per-request tap."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1968
msgid "Preset: Default"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1969
msgid ""
"Recommended balance. Share reading progress and chapter info for context-"
"aware features. Personal content (highlights, annotations, notebook) stays "
"private."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1976
msgid "Preset: Minimal"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1977
msgid ""
"Maximum privacy. Disable all extended data sharing including progress and "
"chapter info. Only your question and book metadata are sent."
